  "adaptations": [
    "Removed HomeDb persistence and CLI/pipeline dependencies; SQLite remains owned by Bun.",
    "Added a typed scope-qualified and size-bounded JSON worker API, preserving owner confidence and graph algorithms.",
    "Added cooperative cancellation to graph traversal, scoring, assembly, adjacency and community passes.",
    "Guarded Rust cursor and OXC pre-walk depth before recursive owner extraction.",
    "Reused owner extraction oracle fixtures; removed Agent Home-only persistence tests.",
    "OXC preflight conservatively bounds raw grouping/operator complexity before parsing; literal contents also count."
  ],
